  "content": "<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2><p>This experiment explores a direct, dependable workflow for creating images from natural-language prompts.</p><p>The interface keeps prompt refinement, generation history, and reusable presets in one clear workspace.</p><h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2><h3>Prompt workspace</h3><p>Turn ideas into structured prompts with reusable controls.</p><h3>Fast iteration</h3><p>Compare variations without losing the original direction.</p><h3>Style presets</h3><p>Reuse proven visual directions across experiments.</p><h3>Shareable output</h3><p>Prepare selected results for review and handoff.</p><h2 id=\"technology\">Technology</h2><p>The prototype combines a React client with a FastAPI orchestration layer and a swappable image-model adapter.</p><p>Shared tokens and reusable interaction patterns keep the experience consistent as new models are evaluated.</p>",
